    {
      "key_point_id": "kp_identity",
      "statement": "Correct complete objects, conserved stoichiometry, declared states and energy reference. Validate actual atom maps and raw calculation identity before dependent scores. Use the exact mapped norDTCO C10H14S2 graph already supplied, with S16/S17, and source DTCO (1,5-dithiacyclooctane C6H12S2) as the rigidity control. Each neutral is charge 0 singlet and radical cation charge +1 doublet. Compare each at its own relaxed backbone and vertically on the other oxidation-state geometry in gas phase. A geometric S...S contact is not a covalent edge in the starting neutral graph.",
      "expected": "Correct complete objects, conserved stoichiometry, declared states and energy reference. Validate actual atom maps and raw calculation identity before dependent scores. Use the exact mapped norDTCO C10H14S2 graph already supplied, with S16/S17, and source DTCO (1,5-dithiacyclooctane C6H12S2) as the rigidity control. Each neutral is charge 0 singlet and radical cation charge +1 doublet. Compare each at its own relaxed backbone and vertically on the other oxidation-state geometry in gas phase. A geometric S...S contact is not a covalent edge in the starting neutral graph.",
